body:
Extract evidence from the candidate's CV for the job below:

the match percentage is computed from what you extract.

Return ONLY one JSON object with exactly these keys:

{
  "required_skills": [
    {
      "skill": "<a skill from REQUIRED>",
      "quote": "<exact text copied from the CV>"
    }
  ],
  "nice_skills": [
    {
      "skill": "<a skill from NICE TO HAVE>",
      "quote": "<exact text copied from the CV>"
    }
  ],
  "years_experience": {
    "value": <integer>,
    "quote": "<exact text copied from the CV>"
  },
  "degree": {
    "value": true or false,
    "quote": "<exact text copied from the CV>"
  },
  "strengths": [<up to 4 short strings for the recruiter>],
  "gaps": [<up to 4 short strings for the recruiter>]
}

Rules:
- List a skill only if the CV shows it. Leave it out if it is missing.
- Every quote must be copied word for word from the CV: one line, at most 15 words.
- Use the skill names exactly as written in the lists.
Candidates with a match of 80% or more are shortlisted automatically.
